<title>USA: Thompson PBE Inc Q4 loss vs profit.</title>
<headline>Thompson PBE Inc Q4 loss vs profit.</headline>
<dateline>MARINA DEL REY, Calif. 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>(All figures in thousands, except per-share data)</p>
<p>			   Three months Ended	 Year Ended</p>
<p>				  Sept. 30,		 Sept. 30,</p>
<p>				 1996	 1995	1996	1995</p>
<p> Net sales		$ 50,055   $ 38,621  $178,139  $131,827</p>
<p> Net income (loss)     (2,473)	1,117     1,073     3,758</p>
<p> Shr			 ($0.28)	$0.17     $0.12     $0.57</p>
<p> Avg shrs		    8,692	6,683     8,850     6,626</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 and year 1996 net includes charges totaling $4,866,000.</p>
<p>1995 results are pro forma and assume IPO was effective at beginning of fiscal year. Year 1995 net does not reflect an extraordinary charge of $445,000 related to the early extinguishment in November 1994 of a senior subordinated note payable.</p>
</text>
